#: src/reference/reference/remote-cache-setup.md:1
msgid "Remote cache setup"
msgstr "リモート・キャッシュの設定"

#: src/reference/reference/remote-cache-setup.md:4
msgid ""
"This page covers remote caching setup. See [Caching](../concepts/caching."
"html) for general explanation of the caching system."
msgstr ""
"このページではリモート・キャッシュの設定を説明する。"
"キャッシュシステムの導入として[キャッシュ化](../concepts/caching.html)をまず読んでみてほしい。"

#: src/reference/reference/remote-cache-setup.md:6
msgid "gRPC remote cache"
msgstr "gRPC リモート・キャッシュ"

#: src/reference/reference/remote-cache-setup.md:9
msgid ""
"While there might be multiple remote cache store implemention in the future, "
"sbt 2.0 ships with a gRPC client that is compatible with the Bazel remote "
"cache backends. To configure sbt 2.x, add the following to `project/plugins."
"sbt`"
msgstr ""
"将来的に別のリモートキャッシュストア実装が出てくる可能性はあるが、"
"sbt 2.0 は Bazel リモートキャッシュバックエンドと互換性のある gRPC クライアントを採用して"
"いる。sbt 2.x を設定するには、`project/plugins.sbt` に以下を追加する:"

#: src/reference/reference/remote-cache-setup.md:15
msgid ""
"There are many Bazel remote cache backends, both open source and commercial "
"solutions. While this page documents is not an exhaustive list of all Bazel "
"remote cache implementations, hopefully it shows how sbt 2.x can be set up "
"for wide array of them."
msgstr ""
"Bazel リモートキャッシュバックエンドにはオープンソースおよび商用の多くの実装が"
"ある。このページは全ての Bazel リモートキャッシュ実装を網羅する訳ではないが、"
"多角的に様々な実装向けにセットアップする方法を示す。"

#: src/reference/reference/remote-cache-setup.md:17
msgid "Authentication"
msgstr "認証"

#: src/reference/reference/remote-cache-setup.md:19
msgid ""
"There are a few flavors of [gRPC authentication](https://grpc.io/docs/guides/"
"auth/), and Bazel remote cache backends use various kind of them:"
msgstr ""
"[gRPC 認証](https://grpc.io/docs/guides/auth/)にはいくつかの種類があり、Bazel "
"リモートキャッシュバックエンドは様々な方式を使用する:"

#: src/reference/reference/remote-cache-setup.md:21
msgid "Unauthenticated. Useful for testing."
msgstr "認証なし。テストに有用。"

#: src/reference/reference/remote-cache-setup.md:22
msgid "Default TLS/SSL."
msgstr "デフォルト TLS/SSL。"

#: src/reference/reference/remote-cache-setup.md:23
msgid "TLS/SSL with custom server certificate."
msgstr "カスタムサーバー証明書付き TLS/SSL。"

#: src/reference/reference/remote-cache-setup.md:24
msgid "TTL/SSL with custom server and client certificate, mTLS."
msgstr "カスタムサーバー・クライアント証明書付き TLS/SSL、mTLS。"

#: src/reference/reference/remote-cache-setup.md:25
msgid "Default TLS/SSL with API token header."
msgstr "API トークンヘッダー付きデフォルト TLS/SSL。"

#: src/reference/reference/remote-cache-setup.md:27
msgid "bazel-remote without authentication"
msgstr "認証なしの bazel-remote"

#: src/reference/reference/remote-cache-setup.md:29
msgid ""
"You can grab the code from [buchgr/bazel-remote](https://github.com/buchgr/"
"bazel-remote) and run it on a laptop using Bazel:"
msgstr ""
"[buchgr/bazel-remote](https://github.com/buchgr/bazel-remote) からコードを取得し、"
"Bazel を使ってラップトップで実行できる:"

#: src/reference/reference/remote-cache-setup.md:37
msgid "To configure sbt 2.x, add the following to `project/plugins.sbt`"
msgstr ""
"sbt 2.x を設定するには、`project/plugins.sbt` に以下を追加する:"

#: src/reference/reference/remote-cache-setup.md:43
msgid "and append the following to `build.sbt`:"
msgstr ""
"`build.sbt` に以下を追加する:"

#: src/reference/reference/remote-cache-setup.md:46
msgid "\"grpc://localhost:2024\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/remote-cache-setup.md:49
msgid "bazel-remote with mTLS"
msgstr "mTLS 付き bazel-remote"

#: src/reference/reference/remote-cache-setup.md:51
msgid ""
"In a real environment, mTLS can ensure that the transport is encrypted and "
"mutually authenticated. bazel-remote can be started with something like the "
"follows:"
msgstr ""
"本番環境では、mTLS によりトランスポートの暗号化と相互認証を保証できる。"
"bazel-remote は以下のように起動できる:"

#: src/reference/reference/remote-cache-setup.md:62
msgid "sbt 2.x setting would look like this in this scenario:"
msgstr ""
"このシナリオでは sbt 2.x のセッティングは以下のようになる:"

#: src/reference/reference/remote-cache-setup.md:65
msgid "\"grpcs://localhost:2024\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/remote-cache-setup.md:66
msgid "\"/tmp/sslcert/ca.crt\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/remote-cache-setup.md:67
msgid "\"/tmp/sslcert/client.crt\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/remote-cache-setup.md:68
msgid "\"/tmp/sslcert/client.pem\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/remote-cache-setup.md:71
msgid "Note the `grpcs://`, as opposed to `grpc://`."
msgstr ""
"`grpc://` ではなく `grpcs://` である点に注意。"

#: src/reference/reference/remote-cache-setup.md:73
msgid "EngFlow"
msgstr "EngFlow"

#: src/reference/reference/remote-cache-setup.md:75
msgid ""
"[EngFlow GmbH](https://www.engflow.com/) is a build solution company founded "
"in 2020 by core members of Bazel team, providing build analytics and remote "
"execution backend for Bazel, which includes remote cache."
msgstr ""
"[EngFlow GmbH](https://www.engflow.com/) は Bazel チームのコアメンバーが 2020 年に"
"設立した<nobr>ビルドソリューション</nobr>企業で、Bazel 向けのビルド分析とリモート実行バック"
"エンド（リモートキャッシュを含む）を提供する。"

#: src/reference/reference/remote-cache-setup.md:77
msgid ""
"After signing up for trial on <https://my.engflow.com/>, the page instructs "
"you to start a trial cluster using a docker. If you followed the "
"instruction, this should start a remote cache service on port 8080. The sbt "
"2.x configuration would look like this for the trial cluster:"
msgstr ""
"<https://my.engflow.com/> でトライアルに登録すると、ページの指示に従って Docker "
"で試用クラスターを起動する。指示に従っていれば、ポート 8080 でリモートキャッシュ"
"サービスが起動する。試用クラスター用の sbt 2.x の設定は以下のようになる:"

#: src/reference/reference/remote-cache-setup.md:80
msgid "\"grpc://localhost:8080\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/remote-cache-setup.md:83
msgid "BuildBuddy"
msgstr "BuildBuddy"

#: src/reference/reference/remote-cache-setup.md:85
msgid ""
"[BuildBuddy](https://www.buildbuddy.io/) is a build solution company founded "
"by ex-Google engineers, providing build analytics and remote execution "
"backend for Bazel. It's also available open source as [buildbuddy-io/"
"buildbuddy](https://github.com/buildbuddy-io/buildbuddy)."
msgstr ""
"[BuildBuddy](https://www.buildbuddy.io/) は元 Google エンジニアが設立したビルド"
"ソリューション企業で、Bazel 向けのビルド分析とリモート実行バックエンドを提供する。"
"[buildbuddy-io/buildbuddy](https://github.com/buildbuddy-io/buildbuddy) として"
"オープンソースでも利用可能である。"

#: src/reference/reference/remote-cache-setup.md:87
msgid ""
"After signing up, BuildBuddy Personal plan lets you use BuildBuddy across "
"the Internet."
msgstr ""
"登録後、BuildBuddy Personal プランでインターネット経由で BuildBuddy を利用できる。"

#: src/reference/reference/remote-cache-setup.md:89
msgid ""
"From <https://app.buildbuddy.io/>, go to Settings, and change the "
"Organization URL to `<something>.buildbuddy.io`."
msgstr ""
"<https://app.buildbuddy.io/> から Settings を開いて、Organization URL を "
"`<something>.buildbuddy.io` に変更する。"

#: src/reference/reference/remote-cache-setup.md:90
msgid ""
"Next, go to Quickstart and take note of the URLs and `--remote_headers`."
msgstr ""
"次に Quickstart を開いて、URL と `--remote_headers` をメモする。"

#: src/reference/reference/remote-cache-setup.md:91
msgid ""
"Create a file called `$HOME/.sbt/buildbuddy_credential.txt` and put in the "
"API key:"
msgstr ""
"`$HOME/.sbt/buildbuddy_credential.txt` というファイルを作成し、API キーを記述する:"

#: src/reference/reference/remote-cache-setup.md:97
#: src/reference/reference/remote-cache-setup.md:115
msgid "The sbt 2.x configuration would look like this:"
msgstr ""
"sbt 2.x の設定は以下のようになる:"

#: src/reference/reference/remote-cache-setup.md:100
msgid "\"grpcs://something.buildbuddy.io\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/remote-cache-setup.md:101
msgid "\"buildbuddy_credential.txt\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/remote-cache-setup.md:104
msgid "NativeLink"
msgstr "NativeLink"

#: src/reference/reference/remote-cache-setup.md:106
msgid ""
"[NativeLink](https://docs.nativelink.dev/) is an open-source Bazel remote "
"execution backend implementated in Rust with emphasis on performance. As of "
"June 2024, there's NativeLink Cloud in beta."
msgstr ""
"[NativeLink](https://docs.nativelink.dev/) は Rust で実装されたオープンソースの "
"Bazel リモート実行バックエンドで、パフォーマンスを重視している。2024 年 6 月時点"
"で NativeLink Cloud がベータ提供されている。"

#: src/reference/reference/remote-cache-setup.md:108
msgid ""
"From <https://app.nativelink.com/>, go to Quickstart and take note of the "
"URLs and `--remote_header`."
msgstr ""
"<https://app.nativelink.com/> から Quickstart を開いて、URL と <nobr>`--remote_header`</nobr> "
"をメモする。"

#: src/reference/reference/remote-cache-setup.md:109
msgid ""
"Create a file called `$HOME/.sbt/nativelink_credential.txt` and put in the "
"API key:"
msgstr ""
"`$HOME/.sbt/nativelink_credential.txt` というファイルを作成し、API キーを記述する:"

#: src/reference/reference/remote-cache-setup.md:118
msgid "\"grpcs://something.build-faster.nativelink.net\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/remote-cache-setup.md:119
msgid "\"nativelink_credential.txt\""
msgstr ""
